# must be tracked so the FJMS sidecar exporter (Plan 03) can read the
# committed qualifying-set as its only InventoryId source. Pattern uses
# `fist_data/*` (not `fist_data/`) so the !-exception works correctly:
# git cannot re-include files inside an excluded *directory*, but can
# re-include files inside an excluded *glob* pattern.
!fist_data/synthetic_manifest.json
